    "state": "{\"artifact_type\":\"document\",\"checksum\":\"sha256:ac102bef397b346e3aa81fa3089e85215d7cb45311b300f4dee12e75c7c92a99\",\"checksum_basis\":\"asserted\",\"description\":\"The home page, rewritten 2026-10-12, in this order:\\n- \\\"You decide. The AI helps. reflow2 remembers why.\\\"\\n- What it is and isn't, including that reflow2 runs no AI, doesn't replace people or their conversations, and isn't needed for one-afternoon jobs.\\n- The three partners, each with what it brings and can't be trusted with.\\n- The five decision steps (notice, look into it, weigh the options, decide, learn), each with what goes wrong and what reflow2 does.\\n- What the record keeps.\\n- A pointer to walkthrough.html.\\n- The hub as the next step.\\nIt uses the made-up Gearheads, and \\\"project brain\\\" names only a hub. The footer says which release it was checked against.\",\"location\":\"site/index.html\",\"name\":\"site/index.html — what reflow2 is and isn't: a partnership, told along the five decision steps\",\"status\":\"realized\"}",
